          "actions": [
            {
              "action": "describe",
              "parameters": [
                "You sit down on the lee side with the cairn at your back and the old woman on your left, and she says nothing else at all.\n\nThe valley lies there being empty: the hollow with its word in it, the dark slot of the cave mouth, the cold camp off to the east. Nothing in you closes over — a wound wants more than company — but you stay a while, and you get up less alone than you sat down."
